    "body": "By mirror image, I meant (also simplifying the syntax a bit) acquire-read-release:\n```\n    memory_model_acquire() if (aq == 1'b1)\n\n    Bits<LEN> value = read_physical_memory<LEN>(result.paddr);\n\n    memory_model_release() if (rl == 1'b1)\n```\n\n(Maybe use that syntax for this and the \"write\" case.)",
